00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:56.660
Me too.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:58.670
Yeah, I am too.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.380
Another Super Saiyan!

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:06.380
I've got to have it! I've got to experience it!

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:07.300
Oh my gosh.

00:20:07.996 --> 00:20:09.596
Goodbye, whoever you are.

00:20:10.396 --> 00:20:10.896
Wow!

00:20:11.516 --> 00:20:12.316
Gosh, Dad.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.420
Do you really believe that that guy came from the future?

00:20:15.516 --> 00:20:16.696
Yes, I do, son.

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:18.300
Yes, I do.

00:20:18.652 --> 00:20:22.572
As the young Super Saiyan named Trunks heads downstream in the river of time,

00:20:22.972 --> 00:20:26.412
Goku and the others consider the fantastic prophecies he left behind.

00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:29.712
Next time on Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:40.540
On the next episode of Dragon Ball Z, it's serious business as Piccolo, Matita, Yamcha, Tien, Gohan, and Krillin are all mad at Goku.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.860
Even Bulma gives him a dressing down.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:46.780
But for what? Did Goku spill the beans?
